--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -13,3 +13,13 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 ```bash
 npm run dev
 ```
+
+## Authentication
+
+Auth is handled by [Better Auth](https://better-auth.com) (email + password and Google), with users and sessions stored in a local SQLite file (Node's built-in `node:sqlite`, so Node 22.13+ is required).
+
+1. `cp .env.example .env.local` and set `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` (`openssl rand -base64 32`).
+2. For Google sign-in, create an OAuth client and add `http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google` as a redirect URI. With no Google credentials set, the Google button is hidden.
+3. `npm run dev`. Tables are created automatically on boot (`src/instrumentation.ts`).
+
+`/dashboard` requires a session: `src/proxy.ts` redirects requests without a session cookie, and the page itself validates the session via `getCurrentUser()` in `src/lib/users.ts`.
